                            {
                                "example_id": "59adea40-243e-438b-9024-dad610c7bde8",
                                "sense_id": "5ce2e7be-ef6d-32df-a9e6-4b227ab3d9e3",
                                "text": "The miscellaneous setting of horses, dogs, saddles, wagons, guns, and cow-punchers' paraphernalia oppressed the metropolitan eye of the wrecked sportsman."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6c331ea6-b102-4e73-95e3-9f7cb6255073",
                                "sense_id": "5ce2e7be-ef6d-32df-a9e6-4b227ab3d9e3",
                                "text": "\"They might keep you in jail six months before trial, that's a scheme this new prosecutor's got to break a man and make him so weak he'll convict himself. My advice to you is keep out of it. A cowpuncher's got no business to set up as a killer in these degenerate times, Gustin; that's a luxurious distinction only a man with money can afford. Let that feller go. If he deserves killin', somebody'll come along in time and do it, and save you the trouble and expense.\""
                            }
